      <div>
        <h3>Domain interpretation · open</h3>
        <p>This instrument has no domain author yet. Someone in trade economics or industrial policy. The instrument places Indonesia in the product space and tracks its complexity over time. What is missing is what economic complexity does and does not predict for a commodity exporter, and whether the product-space frame fits Indonesia's actual industrial position.</p>
        <p class="sm">Write the interpretation and take <b>first author</b>; the instrument's author above becomes <b>methods co-author</b> for the analysis and evaluation already built here.</p>
